Package: SeuratESFS
Title: Seurat Wrapper for ESFS (Entropy Sorting Feature Selection)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Arthur", "Radley", email = "arthur.radley.1993@gmail.com",
  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Seurat-compatible wrapper functions for the ESFS Python
    package (Entropy Sorting Feature Selection). ESFS identifies marker genes
    and performs feature selection in single-cell RNA sequencing data using
    information-theoretic metrics, without requiring prior cell type labels or
    dimensionality reduction. This wrapper allows R/Seurat users to run the
    full ESFS workflow — including ES-GSS, ES-CCF, and ES-FMG — directly on
    Seurat objects, with automatic GPU acceleration via CUDA (NVIDIA) or
    MLX/Metal (Apple Silicon) where available.
